OL,3,GNEWSAResident's petition for Ali G
OL,4,Alandmark in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition calling for an attraction
OL,7,Fcelebrating Ali G in a Surrey town is
OL,8,Fto be discussed by councillors.
OL,10,FResidents of Staines launched the
OL,11,Fpetition in light of the fictional
OL,12,Fcharacter's new film, to be released in
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FAlex Balkan, petition organiser and
OL,16,Flocal resident since 2015, said that he
OL,17,Fwanted the town to embrace its
OL,18,Fassociation with the Sacha Baron Cohen
OL,19,Fcharacter in good humour.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
